{
  "id": "ss.terrain.stalag",
  "name": "Stalagmites (SS)",
  "description": "The Spider Cave's blocking prop: dripstone, drawn at the same three-quarter tilt as the den's spires so the two stages' props sit in one world. Three columns rather than one, of three different heights and none of them straight \u2014 a single cone reads as a traffic cone at any size, and a cluster reads as ground that grew. Banded across (a stalagmite is laid down in courses), lit from above down one flank, standing in the wet pool it is still growing out of. What tells it from the crystal spire it shares a silhouette with: the spire is faceted and lit from inside, this is layered and lit from over your shoulder.",
